 "what": "the files the served zones record by name and sha256 that neither lane holds any more: 47 identity bridges (the record each book's text was checked against when its zone was built) and 5 C0 ledger maps. They are provenance, not inputs: the round's re-projection from the store's v2 alone gave back every served zone and sidecar byte for byte without them (the proof of 8 November). The zones are not rewritten for this: each pin stands as its zone wrote it, and this record says of each that the file was not kept, who looked, and where.",
 "recorded_on": "2026-11-10",
 "searched": [
  {
   "by": "the corpus lane (Moses), relay v166, 8 November 2026",
   "relay_sha256": "a1320a4764337b3b5f67e01e1790f94513c9d8d2ee968daab8856eef6f09465c",
   "words": "Not found anywhere: the 47 identity bridges («amos-bridge.csv.gz» and the rest) and the 5 C0 ledger maps. No file under those names stands on this computer, and a scan of every file by sha256 against the 52 fingerprints found none: the 999 footsteps folder (698,160 files, 74.5 GB), the Tabernacle folder (456,804 files), Downloads and Desktop (7,389 files). The store's listing of 17 October holds no bridge files, and the October delete records name none. So these 52 were not kept after your zones pinned them."
  },
  {
   "by": "the page lane (Elijah), 8 November 2026",
   "words": "the repository's history, every branch (13: main, gh-pages, workbench-archive, the two October archives and the working branches), searched by name for *-bridge.csv.gz and cleanroom-c0-ledger-map-*: no commit ever held one; the store's v2/ and its old-layout folders, listed: none under these names"
  }
 ],
 "standing": "not kept. Nothing is restored from a guess: a file is the bytes its sha256 names or it is not that file. Road A's rebuild, built from the sources with its own receipts, supersedes these as the record a book's text is checked against (the corpus lane, v166).",
